inventory/legacy/fetched/nara-*/*.gif
inventory/legacy/fetched/nara-*/*.pdf

# Legislative districts research sources (4 October 2026): Statements of Vote, records of members, district block files; 175 MB, re-obtainable from the URLs in the manifest, which is kept.
